{c_label}Lucky Hit:{/c} Dealing damage to an enemy affected by a {c_important}Trap{/c} Skill has up to a {c_number}{SF_0}%{/c} chance to:
{icon:bullet,1.2} Reduce the active Cooldowns of your {c_important}Trap{/c} Skills by {c_number}[{SF_2}*100|%|]{/c}
{icon:bullet,1.2} Increase your {c_important}Trap{/c} Skill damage by {c_number}[SF_6*100|x%|]{/c} for {c_number}[SF_8]{/c} seconds, stacking up to {c_number}[SF_6 * SF_7 *100|x%|]{/c}
